{"id":"en_my-bride-is-the-mafia-queen","title":"My Bride is the Mafia Queen","titleEn":"My Bride is the Mafia Queen","description":"After serving five years behind bars for a crime she took on behalf of her family, mafia boss Evelyn returns to find her daughter has suffered abuse. Her release also brings her back into contact with Felix, the man she shared a single night with. The series follows Evelyn as she confronts the fallout of her sacrifice and reconnects with the people from her past. Dramzio is one place where viewers can follow the series.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/764a5d4c5dfbdfa9/cs_CZ/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/764a5d4c5dfbdfa9/cs_CZ/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Serendipity","Group Pampering","Serendipity","Group Pampering","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dstc4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-bride-is-the-mafia-queen_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dstc4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-bride-is-the-mafia-queen_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dstc4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-bride-is-the-mafia-queen_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dstc4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-bride-is-the-mafia-queen_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dstc4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-bride-is-the-mafia-